/dist
/build
# Every variant's build output: dist-v1, dist-v1-bundle, dist-portable-v1, dist-appimage-v1,
# dist-service, build-v1, build-appimage-v1 ... push_commit.py only skips top-level `dist` and
# `dl`, so without this a build tree would be committed as if it were source. The leading slash
# anchors these to packaging/ — they are directory names, not patterns to match anywhere.
/dist-*
/build-*
*.pyc
__pycache__
